1
00:00:05,210 --> 00:00:09,230
♪La la la la la la, la la la la la la♪

2
00:00:09,370 --> 00:00:12,740
♪La la la la la la la la la♪

3
00:00:12,910 --> 00:00:16,330
♪No matter what day it is,
I'll spend it with you♪

4
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:19,100
♪We're more sure
of each other than ever♪

5
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,060
=Watching Heart Signal with You=

6
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,380
(Before the viewing session begins)

7
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:26,800
Microphone check.

8
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:27,760
One, two, three.

9
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:29,480
One, two, three.

10
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:33,560
I'm really looking forward to this.
This is my first time getting...

11
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,000
Early access.

12
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,520
Yes, early access.

13
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:38,760
We're here to gossip.

14
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:40,720
Let's see who makes a good couple.

15
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:42,280
There's no need to look.

16
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:43,520
Why bother looking?

17
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:45,640
Let's root for "Everlasting YiHeng".

18
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:47,360
"YuLiang Never Fades".

19
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:48,960
Everlasting YiHeng, Yes.

20
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:51,920
It feels like we're watching
from the outside.

21
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:52,840
Looking back at the things

22
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:54,720
we did, they really are quite amusing.

23
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,760
It's even funnier watching ourselves.

24
00:00:56,760 --> 00:00:57,560
Yes.

25
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:58,400
Okay, let's welcome

26
00:00:58,400 --> 00:00:59,680
some new friends, shall we?

27
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:00,560
(New friends)

28
00:01:00,560 --> 00:01:01,240
Not exactly new.

29
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:01,920
We're old friends.

30
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:02,800
But this is your first time.

31
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:04,600
As for "Watching Together,"
we're new.

32
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:05,440
Yes. Let's welcome them.

33
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,040
Welcome Cui Kaiyi and Zhao Xilun.

34
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:08,080
Hello.

35
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:10,600
I'm a cast member from Season 9,

36
00:01:10,600 --> 00:01:11,660
(Cui Kaiyi)
Cui Kaiyi.

37
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,200
Hello, everyone.

38
00:01:12,560 --> 00:01:13,640
Welcome.

39
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:14,320
Welcome.

40
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:15,120
Hello.

41
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:17,200
(Zhao Xilun)
I'm a cast member from Season 9,

42
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:17,680
Zhao Xilun.

43
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:18,480
Hello.

44
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:20,240
(Sun Bohan)
I'm a cast member from Season 9,

45
00:01:20,240 --> 00:01:20,920
Sun Bohan.

46
00:01:20,920 --> 00:01:21,520
Hello, everyone.

47
00:01:21,520 --> 00:01:24,160
I'm a cast member from Season 9.

48
00:01:24,160 --> 00:01:25,120
(Chen Hewen)
My name is Chen Hewen.

49
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:27,560
Applause.

50
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,680
Sun Bohan and I were

51
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:32,240
on "Watching Heart Signal with You"
last time.

52
00:01:32,240 --> 00:01:33,160
Yes.

53
00:01:33,160 --> 00:01:34,440
So before we came here,

54
00:01:34,440 --> 00:01:36,760
there was actually a rule.

55
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:38,760
It's one of the rules
of "Watching Heart Signal with You".

56
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:40,080
Those who join later

57
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:42,080
are considered our juniors.

58
00:01:43,320 --> 00:01:44,680
That means you have to pour us

59
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:45,520
some water.

60
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:46,320
Pour us some tea.

61
00:01:46,860 --> 00:01:48,680
(Accepted immediately)
Here you go.

62
00:01:50,160 --> 00:01:50,920
Ladies first.

63
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:53,000
I should have been
the one doing it, too.

64
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:53,840
Thank you.

65
00:01:56,520 --> 00:01:57,120
Thank you.

66
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,720
Actually, next time,

67
00:01:58,720 --> 00:01:59,640
if you become the seniors,

68
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:00,480
you can make up

69
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:02,160
your own rules.

70
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:03,280
So you finally admit it.

71
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:04,160
You just made that up.

72
00:02:04,160 --> 00:02:05,480
We were completely making things up.

73
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:07,120
Cheers.

74
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,120
Come on.

75
00:02:08,240 --> 00:02:09,080
Season 9.

76
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,400
May it last forever.

77
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:14,440
Zhao Xilun made the tea taste even better.

78
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:16,480
He added his own special touch to it.

79
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:18,360
I'm nervous.

80
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,720
I'm a little nervous, too.

81
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:20,480
Me too. I need some water.

82
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:21,880
Why does the person I see on TV

83
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:23,480
look so different from me now?

84
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:25,640
Last time I appeared
on "Watching Heart Signal with You,"

85
00:02:25,640 --> 00:02:26,760
they showed footage of me,

86
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:29,040
and every time someone started talking,
the video would pause.

87
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:30,400
Whenever it froze on my face,

88
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:32,000
I would think I look incredibly fat.

89
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,240
So I would rather watch everyone else.

90
00:02:33,240 --> 00:02:35,480
Seeing myself on screen
is just embarrassing.

91
00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:37,080
It may look like I don't care,

92
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:38,320
but I actually care very much.

93
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:40,640
How about you all?

94
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:42,080
You've probably been reading

95
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:43,800
the comments about yourselves lately.

96
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:44,960
Did anything in particular leave...

97
00:02:44,960 --> 00:02:45,940
Leave a lasting impression.

98
00:02:45,940 --> 00:02:46,480
A lasting impression?

99
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:46,960
Have you seen

100
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:48,080
any comments about the others?

101
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,080
Who wants to go first?

102
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:51,800
I've seen the most comments
about myself.

103
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:54,160
A lot of people online
call me "Fat Chen".

104
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:58,960
But you've lost a lot of weight
since then.

105
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:00,640
I've lost some weight.

106
00:03:00,640 --> 00:03:02,760
I think all of us guys
have gotten slimmer.

107
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:04,800
And the girls
have always looked beautiful.

108
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:05,280
Very beautiful.

109
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:05,920
Always beautiful.

110
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:06,400
They've kept that.

111
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,680
There's barely any room for improvement.

112
00:03:09,360 --> 00:03:10,040
Not for Cui Kaiyi.

113
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:11,080
Cui Kaiyi is our "little sunshine",

114
00:03:11,600 --> 00:03:12,080
Yes.

115
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,800
Our energetic ray of sunshine.

116
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,360
All right.

117
00:03:14,360 --> 00:03:16,000
Wasn't I supposed
to speak for the audience?

118
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:17,920
I'm "Oily Sun".

119
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:19,520
You've never been oily.

120
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:20,240
I don't think you ever have.

121
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:20,960
Never been oily.

122
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:22,880
You're simply confident
and straightforward.

123
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:24,480
I'm open, even when I seem reserved.

124
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:26,800
I never noticed you were reserved.

125
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:28,240
Mostly because you were nervous

126
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,000
during your first two days.

127
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:30,280
You were nervous
because you warm up slowly.

128
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:30,960
Yes.

129
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:31,520
Everyone

130
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,720
was nervous at the time.

131
00:03:32,720 --> 00:03:33,280
And I also owe

132
00:03:33,280 --> 00:03:34,680
Cui Kaiyi an apology.

133
00:03:34,880 --> 00:03:36,360
When we were in the house,

134
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:38,480
I actually felt quite guilty
during those first two days.

135
00:03:38,480 --> 00:03:40,000
I can vouch for Sun Bohan.

136
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:40,480
When we talked

137
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:42,320
at night, he mentioned it himself.

138
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:43,120
You two talked every night.

139
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:44,680
Yes. Every day, he would tell me,

140
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:46,480
"How could I have acted
that way that day?"

141
00:03:46,480 --> 00:03:47,560
"What was I thinking at the time?"

142
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,720
You were just nervous.

143
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:50,520
Everyone's nervous
when they first enter the house.

144
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,520
When I'm nervous, I tend to talk a lot.

145
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:54,120
But when Cui Kaiyi talks,

146
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,320
everything she says is so appropriate.

147
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:57,280
Yes. She always makes people
feel comfortable.

148
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:59,080
All right. When is all this praise
going to end?

149
00:03:59,080 --> 00:04:00,600
I'm starting to feel overwhelmed.

150
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:04,000
I heard today's episode
is supposed to be quite interesting.

151
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,160
I'm really looking forward to it.

152
00:04:05,720 --> 00:04:07,640
Well, why don't we watch
the main episode?

153
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:08,960
All right.

154
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:10,120
I'm looking forward to it. Let's go.

155
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:11,230
I'm a little nervous.

156
00:04:11,230 --> 00:04:11,740
Oh, my goodness.

157
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:14,690
♪Shining in your eyes♪

158
00:04:15,160 --> 00:04:16,200
I just realized our opening song

159
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:17,280
is actually...

160
00:04:17,640 --> 00:04:18,560
It's incredibly catchy.

161
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:19,000
Yes.

162
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:19,600
It sounds great.

163
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:21,240
Heart Signal.

164
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:22,340
=Heart Signal (China Version) S9=

165
00:04:22,970 --> 00:04:23,440
Here we go.

166
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,360
We're here, too.

167
00:04:24,870 --> 00:04:25,630
Here we go.

168
00:04:25,630 --> 00:04:27,130
We meet again.

169
00:04:28,180 --> 00:04:29,620
(Turns around)

170
00:04:36,140 --> 00:04:36,980
He's completely numb.

171
00:04:37,420 --> 00:04:38,340
(Opens the door)

172
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:39,380
A cure for heartbreak.

173
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:40,520
I can't watch anymore.

174
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:41,610
So, at first glance...

175
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,320
Don't worry. We can watch it.

176
00:04:43,320 --> 00:04:43,870
They're here.

177
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:45,480
We gossipers can handle this,

178
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,160
right, Cui Kaiyi?

179
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:46,920
Yes.

180
00:04:47,360 --> 00:04:48,400
I love watching this.

181
00:04:48,540 --> 00:04:49,180
Hello.

182
00:04:49,440 --> 00:04:49,900
Hello.

183
00:04:49,900 --> 00:04:50,780
Then I came out

184
00:04:50,780 --> 00:04:52,180
and happened to see you two talking.

185
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:54,220
Did you know
this was the stargazing card?

186
00:04:54,220 --> 00:04:55,680
(Stargazing Room Invitation Card)
Not really.

187
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:57,000
- None of us had seen it before.
- I didn't expect it.

188
00:04:57,520 --> 00:04:59,000
I only realized it
might be the stargazing card

189
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,120
when I came downstairs.

190
00:05:02,690 --> 00:05:03,270
Actually,

191
00:05:03,580 --> 00:05:04,560
I wanted to apologize.

192
00:05:04,810 --> 00:05:06,000
You two can keep talking.

193
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:06,770
I will...

194
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:07,980
(Chooses to leave)
That's fine.

195
00:05:07,980 --> 00:05:08,690
No worries.

196
00:05:09,330 --> 00:05:09,700
See you.

197
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,520
Sha Yue'er is really showing off
her queen energy.

198
00:05:11,520 --> 00:05:12,080
It's okay.

199
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:13,120
It's okay, go ahead.

200
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:13,680
No worries.

201
00:05:13,680 --> 00:05:15,360
That's just how Sha Yue'er is.

202
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:16,560
Because that day was actually

203
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:17,720
rather awkward.

204
00:05:17,720 --> 00:05:18,920
Sha Yue'er thought

205
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,440
we would have dinner or something,

206
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:21,360
but she didn't know

207
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:23,160
that I might have had two dates
that day.

208
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,640
So I wanted to apologize to her.

209
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:27,040
Otherwise, it would
have felt too abrupt.

210
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,560
It was during your first date, right?

211
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:30,840
Yes. We only did
some handicrafts together.

212
00:05:31,350 --> 00:05:31,640
Right.

213
00:05:31,640 --> 00:05:32,800
You did not have much time?

214
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,480
I understand.

215
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:35,960
When Zhao Xilun arrived,

216
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:36,920
I was actually a little

217
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:37,680
confused.

218
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:39,240
I didn't understand
why you were apologizing.

219
00:05:39,240 --> 00:05:40,400
I wondered
what you were apologizing for.

220
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:41,120
I didn't know

221
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:41,480
what happened

222
00:05:41,480 --> 00:05:42,120
between you two.

223
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:42,600
Yes.

224
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,840
But I did know

225
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:44,480
you had a date,

226
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,640
because I knew you got
"The Courageous" card.

227
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:46,840
So I was like, why don't you two talk?

228
00:05:46,840 --> 00:05:47,720
I'll give you some privacy.

229
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:48,880
It did not feel right

230
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:50,360
to interrupt you and Sha Yue'er

231
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:51,640
at that moment.

232
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:53,040
It's fine. I understand.

233
00:05:54,740 --> 00:05:56,150
(Checks the rules board)

234
00:05:56,150 --> 00:05:58,790
I'm going over everything
that happened today.

235
00:05:59,330 --> 00:05:59,950
He's checking the rules.

236
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:01,760
And I actually misunderstood
the rules at the time.

237
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:03,520
(House Rules)
I thought you could only

238
00:06:03,520 --> 00:06:05,400
have one stargazing-room date per week.

239
00:06:05,400 --> 00:06:06,120
Once you voted for it,

240
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:07,080
no one else could vote for it

241
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:07,920
that week.

242
00:06:08,620 --> 00:06:10,060
Oh, no. He's probably regretting it now.

243
00:06:10,330 --> 00:06:12,060
Why didn't I do that?

244
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,510
I suddenly have nothing to do.

245
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,040
Si, you can take a break.

246
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:15,680
I'll just wash these.

247
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,920
(Wash these for me when you're done)
Si is always quietly keeping busy.

248
00:06:18,220 --> 00:06:18,850
I've never used this.

249
00:06:18,870 --> 00:06:19,780
Just put it back if you never used it.

250
00:06:19,780 --> 00:06:20,640
Sure.

251
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:22,000
He needs something to do.

252
00:06:22,550 --> 00:06:23,280
When his hands are idle,

253
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:24,410
his mind starts working overtime.

254
00:06:24,520 --> 00:06:25,720
His mind must be racing now.

255
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,920
I'm the same way when I wash dishes.

256
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,920
I still hadn't
completely moved on from everything

257
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:30,320
that happened in the stargazing room.

258
00:06:30,320 --> 00:06:32,280
It looks like you're washing chopsticks,

259
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:34,040
but your mind has wandered
somewhere else, right?

260
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,760
Yes. I need to keep my hands busy.

261
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:36,760
That's how it is.

262
00:06:37,280 --> 00:06:38,640
I can relate to that feeling, too.

263
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:39,600
For example,

264
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:41,120
if someone takes her out on a date,

265
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:41,760
I suddenly

266
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:42,840
feel like

267
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:43,640
I had nothing to do.

268
00:06:43,640 --> 00:06:44,440
Yes.

269
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:45,640
Your mind suddenly goes blank,

270
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:47,240
and you feel like
you're wandering around aimlessly.

271
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,000
Yes.

272
00:06:51,910 --> 00:06:52,680
Oh, my goodness.

273
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,720
I look so silly when I smile.

274
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:57,050
Sun Bohan is actually adorable.

275
00:06:57,050 --> 00:06:57,500
Seriously...

276
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:58,960
He looks so cute when he smiles.

277
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:01,080
Everyone noticed it at the time.

278
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:01,760
Everyone noticed it.

279
00:07:01,760 --> 00:07:02,680
Especially that day, because it

280
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,480
was our first time seeing them.

281
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,120
