not that I've changed direction.

1118
00:28:43,960 --> 00:28:46,560
Maybe I've just been pretty lost before,

1119
00:28:46,560 --> 00:28:47,880
almost like

1120
00:28:47,880 --> 00:28:49,200
I was spinning in circles.

1121
00:28:49,200 --> 00:28:50,480
I'd want to get a little closer,

1122
00:28:50,480 --> 00:28:51,600
but then I'd pull away.

1123
00:28:51,840 --> 00:28:53,280
I'd get closer, then pull away.

1124
00:28:53,280 --> 00:28:54,320
Unlike the first "star" and

1125
00:28:54,320 --> 00:28:55,440
the second "star", who were much braver.

1126
00:28:58,680 --> 00:29:00,120
So after seeing this, Cui Kaiyi,

1127
00:29:00,120 --> 00:29:01,160
what did you feel?

1128
00:29:01,160 --> 00:29:01,960
My biggest feeling?

1129
00:29:01,960 --> 00:29:03,600
At first, I didn't understand it at all.

1130
00:29:03,600 --> 00:29:04,120
Because

1131
00:29:04,440 --> 00:29:05,360
I didn't

1132
00:29:05,360 --> 00:29:07,000
I didn't realize
what was going on with you guys.

1133
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:07,720
Because at Signal House,

1134
00:29:07,720 --> 00:29:09,560
everyone seemed so happy.

1135
00:29:09,760 --> 00:29:11,240
And then Sha Yue'er came back.

1136
00:29:11,240 --> 00:29:13,440
From her perspective, she couldn't see

1137
00:29:13,600 --> 00:29:15,240
all those inner conflicts

1138
00:29:15,240 --> 00:29:15,880
or whatever.

1139
00:29:15,880 --> 00:29:16,920
She could only see

1140
00:29:16,920 --> 00:29:18,120
what you actually expressed.

1141
00:29:18,120 --> 00:29:18,640
Yeah.

1142
00:29:20,120 --> 00:29:21,680
So when I watched it today,

1143
00:29:21,680 --> 00:29:23,360
I was really happy for her.

1144
00:29:23,360 --> 00:29:24,880
There are so many great guys
at Signal House

1145
00:29:24,880 --> 00:29:26,960
who are interested in her

1146
00:29:26,960 --> 00:29:28,120
and have feelings for her.

1147
00:29:28,640 --> 00:29:30,680
Second, I felt like everyone

1148
00:29:30,680 --> 00:29:31,600
was really sincere.

1149
00:29:31,600 --> 00:29:33,760
No matter which "star" they are,

1150
00:29:33,760 --> 00:29:34,840
they're all trying

1151
00:29:34,840 --> 00:29:36,040
to help the "moon"

1152
00:29:36,040 --> 00:29:38,800
become whole, better, and beautiful.

1153
00:29:43,120 --> 00:29:43,780
Oh my.

1154
00:29:44,570 --> 00:29:45,290
Let's go upstairs first.

1155
00:29:45,290 --> 00:29:45,750
Okay.

1156
00:29:46,560 --> 00:29:47,610
Hi.

1157
00:29:48,520 --> 00:29:50,020
Hello.

1158
00:29:50,300 --> 00:29:52,100
(Looks up)

1159
00:29:52,960 --> 00:29:53,640
(Bumps into something)

1160
00:30:02,110 --> 00:30:03,600
You look beautiful today.

1161
00:30:04,080 --> 00:30:05,920
You've zoned out, haven't you?

1162
00:30:06,680 --> 00:30:08,480
From my perspective, I don't know

1163
00:30:08,480 --> 00:30:10,400
what Chen Hewen and Sha Yue'er

1164
00:30:10,400 --> 00:30:12,080
are like together.

1165
00:30:12,600 --> 00:30:13,400
Honestly, I was...

1166
00:30:14,480 --> 00:30:15,400
at a loss. Yeah.

1167
00:30:15,400 --> 00:30:16,280
Mostly, I was just conflicted.

1168
00:30:19,870 --> 00:30:20,850
You like blue.

1169
00:30:20,850 --> 00:30:21,630
I picked this out myself.

1170
00:30:21,630 --> 00:30:22,790
(Sha Yue'er's favorite color)
It's so pretty.

1171
00:30:22,790 --> 00:30:23,440
And there's more.

1172
00:30:24,050 --> 00:30:24,870
This one is more fitting

1173
00:30:24,870 --> 00:30:26,080
for Children's Day.

1174
00:30:26,080 --> 00:30:26,610
You can display it.

1175
00:30:26,610 --> 00:30:27,430
It's candy-shaped.

1176
00:30:28,320 --> 00:30:31,200
But I heard from Sha Yue'er
that you actually got her four bouquets.

1177
00:30:31,200 --> 00:30:32,880
Yeah, I bought four bouquets.

1178
00:30:32,880 --> 00:30:35,760
I'd give her whichever one
turned out the best.

1179
00:30:35,760 --> 00:30:37,200
Yeah, that's what
I was thinking at the time.

1180
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:39,960
These flowers really are beautiful.

1181
00:30:42,980 --> 00:30:47,060
(Don't go anywhere. The next episode
is even more romantic.)
